# Optional. Enables the dated ground-level viewer in the contract panel.
#
# NO BILLING ACCOUNT IS INVOLVED. Mapillary issues a read-only client token on a
# free account; it is meant to sit in a public bundle and cannot spend anything.
# This is why the ground-level viewer uses Mapillary rather than Google: every
# Google Maps Platform key, including the Embed API whose basic usage is not
# charged, has to sit on a project with billing enabled.
#
#   1. Sign in at https://www.mapillary.com
#   2. Dashboard -> Developers -> Register an application
#   3. Copy the CLIENT TOKEN (starts MLY|...)
#   4. Put it below in a file named .env.local, then restart `npm run dev`
#
# Leave it unset and the panel degrades to out-links, which is the shipped
# default — no broken frame and no dead spinner.
VITE_MAPILLARY_TOKEN=
